         {
            "category": "description",
            "text": "Mojolicious::Plugin::CSRF 1.03 for Perl uses a weak random number source for generating CSRF tokens.  That version of the module generates tokens as an MD5 of the process id, the current time, and a single call to the built-in rand() function.",
            "title": "Vulnerability Description"
         }
